OL,3,GNEWSAFurther arrests over mum-of-two's
OL,4,A'unexplained' death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested by police
OL,7,Finvestigating the unexplained death of
OL,8,Fa "devoted" mother-of-two.
OL,10,FHannah Fry became unwell after police
OL,11,Fwere called to an address in Meadow
OL,12,FCroft, Longridge, on 13 July, and died
OL,13,Fin hospital later that day.
OL,15,FLancashire Police have today arrested a
OL,16,F29-year-old woman on suspicion of
OL,17,Fsupplying prescription medication.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
